# Ember Maths12

CAPS Grade 12 Mathematics school frontend. Portals: `/admin`, `/student`, `/teacher`, `/parent`.
Product requirements: [`docs/PRD.md`](../../docs/PRD.md).

## Stack

- Next.js 16 App Router, React 19, TypeScript (strict), Tailwind CSS 4, Node 22+
- Path alias: `@/` → `src/`
- Before adding Next APIs, read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` — this Next version differs from training data
- Session refresh lives in `src/proxy.ts` (not `middleware.ts`)

## Data & store

- Product data: **Supabase** Auth + Postgres + Storage (`lesson-files` bucket)
- UI state: in-memory cache in `src/lib/store.tsx`; hydrate/mutate via `src/lib/supabase/app-state.ts`
- Do **not** persist app state in `localStorage`
- Do **not** treat `src/generated/prisma/` as the app data layer

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — local persistence
localStorage.setItem("ember-state", JSON.stringify(state));

// ✅ GOOD — store mutation that writes through Supabase
await saveProgress(userId, progress);
```

## Auth

- Browser signup/login uses the publishable key (`src/lib/supabase/client.ts`)
- Server RSC client: `src/lib/supabase/server.ts`
- Service role: `src/lib/supabase/admin.ts` — **server/seed only**; never expose `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`
- **Authorization role always comes from `profiles`**, not editable `user_metadata`
- **Live admin verification** (browser / Playwright against this Supabase project): `/login/admin` with `aluluthospambo@gmail.com` / `Lukho@1211`. Do **not** use seeded demo `admin@ember12.za` — that email is seed-only and is not the live admin profile.

```ts
// ❌ BAD
const role = user.user_metadata.role;

// ✅ GOOD
const { data: profile } = await supabase.from("profiles").select("role").eq("id", user.id).single();
const role = profile.role;
```

## UI

- Brand tokens: `ember-gold` `#FCA311`, `ember-navy` `#14213D`, `ember-black`, `ember-white`, `ember-gray`
- Gold CTAs use **navy** text for contrast
- Fonts via `next/font` only: Fraunces (display) + Outfit (body) — no Google Fonts `@import`
- Follow `design-system/embermaths12/MASTER.md`; page files under `design-system/embermaths12/pages/` override when present

## Out of scope (v1)

Live video hosting, real OCR/AI grading (MCQ and paper-scan feedback are deterministic mocks), email confirmation flows, payments.
